Description: Estimate the outcomes of fourth down plays in National
    Collegiate Athletic Association (NCAA) football and compare the win
    probability of going for it, attempting a field goal and punting. Each
    option is scored with expected points, field goal, fourth down
    conversion and win probability models fitted on 'cfbfastR'
    play-by-play data, following the approach of 'nfl4th' for the
    National Football League. Fourth down plays from a single game can be
    pulled from 'ESPN' and prepared for scoring, and whole seasons of
    'cfbfastR' play-by-play can be loaded with the decision columns
    added.
